# Sync submodules after merge (cursor-packs)

When a PR that touches submodule gitlinks merges, after checkout of that tip, or when pin bumps leave `(new commits)` dirt:

1. Load `.cursor/skills/sync-submodules-after-merge/SKILL.md` and follow its constraints.
2. Run recursive `git submodule update --init` at the parent and inside nests that have their own `.gitmodules`.
3. Do not commit drifted gitlinks just to clear the dirt; do not delete untracked nest content unless the user asks.
